  "groupId": "main_2",
  "stageId": "main_02-01",
  "title": "Tactical Blockage",
  "storyCode": "TR-11",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1e19cc69f0a4dbadd85f128745cfb5b68be41fda3f4d7a4f4998af4fe76d5668",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十三关（前）\n5:57 A.M. \\ Cloudy \\ Visibility: 17 km\nDesert; 4 km from the outskirts of Lungmen\n4 days after the Chernobog rescue mission"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Good morning, Dr. {@nickname}. You have currently been sleeping for 99999----"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "----9999 hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Although your reluctance to leave bed is not beyond reason, your presence is urgently needed at the operations command room."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Furthermore, here is some medical advice from Dr. Kal'tsit: Please keep the windows open to maintain a source of fresh air, and spend some time on the deck to maintain healthy levels of Vitamin D."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Ah, Doctor! Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "So you made it, Dr. {@nickname}."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Doctor, are you feeling better now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "You looked like you were still in pain and and couldn't move around well yesterday."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I've made a complete recovery. How about you?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I'm perfectly fine and full of energy today!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "After all, we still have other missions to take care of..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "So the sooner we can start preparing, the better. Doctor, you should get used to having to shift gears quickly here."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "Doctor,"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "Even though we sustained heavy losses in Chernobog, we gained a lot of information about Reunion and, more importantly, got you out alive."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "Based on the negotiations we had yesterday, the closest nomadic city to us, Lungmen, has offered us a cooperation pact and agreed to exchange information with us."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "We have some evidence that Reunion might be targeting Lungmen next."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "We'll have to wait for Dr. Kal'tsit's permission first before we can get the rest of the information. She's still stationed within Lungmen."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Lungmen has granted us permission to temporary camp near the city. They've also agreed to compensate a portion of our losses and expenditures during the operation."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "In exchanges, Rhodes Island is expected to help defend the city's outskirts."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "But the reason why I called for you so early is..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "Let me explain it, Amiya."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "Last night, we discovered another wave of Chernobog survivors making their way towards Lungmen. They're expected to get there in the afternoon."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "We'll be expected to safeguard the outskirts of District 5 just like the last few days. Only this time, there might be more Reunion members mixed into the group."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "Because the situation is a bit different, we'll need to discuss some new tactics with you before beginning the operation."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Anyway, Doctor, there's a lot to get through today, so..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Let's do our best!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "In any case..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "Both of you, please complete your combat preparations. Doctor, once you've decided on your squad assignments, please let the operators know so that they also have time to prepare."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "We'll set out 15 minutes after you finish your drills."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "Oh, and make sure you're not late this time."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
